<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Breweries year profits steady.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Breweries year profits steady.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result of Nigerian Breweries to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996		1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   12,300    vs    10,800</p>
<p> Profit before taxation 2,580     vs     2,505</p>
<p> Taxation		     786     vs	 728</p>
<p> Profit after taxation  1,794     vs     1,777</p>
<p> Dividend per share:     100 kobo vs 85 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE: Payment date of dividend - June 14, 1997. Closure of register - June 4 - June 10, 1997.</p>
<p>Dutch brewers Heineken own a 28 percent stake in Nigerian Breweries.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
